{"nodes": [{"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms", "label": "Load balancing algorithms", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md"}, {"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_round_robin", "label": "Round Robin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "rationale": "simple and fair when requests cost about the same; a slot gets busier if it keeps receiving heavy requests despite equal request counts"}, {"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_least_connections", "label": "Least Connections", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md"}, {"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_random", "label": "Random", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md"}, {"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_consistent_hashing", "label": "Consistent Hashing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "rationale": "hash a user ID to a server so the same user returns to the same machine; the same principle decides which node stores a key in caching and sharding"}, {"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_virtual_nodes", "label": "Virtual Nodes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "rationale": "with only 3-4 servers hash positions on the ring are uneven; giving each server many virtual points smooths the distribution (law of large numbers)"}, {"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_weighted_round_robin", "label": "Weighted Round Robin / Weighted Least Connections", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md"}, {"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_power_of_two_choices", "label": "Power of Two Choices (P2C)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "rationale": "sample two servers and send to the one with fewer connections; close to Least Connections without tracking every server state in real time"}, {"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_selection_questions", "label": "Two questions for choosing an algorithm", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "rationale": "are tasks equally heavy (if not, Least Connections) and must the same client return to the same machine (if so, Consistent Hashing)"}, {"id": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_load_balancer_demo", "label": "LoadBalancerDemo", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md"}], "edges": [{"source": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms", "target": "src_content_module_02_02_load_balancer_basics", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms", "target": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_round_robin", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms", "target": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_least_connections", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms", "target": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_random", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms", "target": "src_content_module_02_03_lb_algorithms_consistent_hashing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/content/module-02/03-lb-algorithms.md", "weight": 1.